# Build output
/aurvet
/dist/
/vendor/modules.txt.bak

# Go test/coverage artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Guild workspace — local orchestration state, excluded from the repo in full.
#
# Previously only the noisiest subtrees were ignored (runs/*/logs/, agent-bus/,
# resolved-settings.json, hosts/) while specs, plans, agents, wiki pages and run
# receipts were tracked. That split leaked local absolute paths into history via
# the tracked half — handoff receipts and review/verify artifacts quote tool
# output and file paths verbatim — so the whole directory is now excluded and was
# purged from history before the first push.
#
# Nothing here is needed to build, test or audit the tool: the durable record is
# the commit history, docs/spec.html, and docs/superpowers/plans/. Guild
# regenerates this workspace locally on demand.
.guild/

# Local-only operator config
*.local.json
